From 4d2d8869d1cb1f053fc54c7766bdef130f18ead2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:31:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] webOS: Read 204 and 304 responses as having no body

A response without Content-Length that is not chunked was read until
the server closed the connection. A 204 or 304 never has a body (RFC
9112 6.3), and on a kept-alive connection the server does not close it,
so the answer was only reported when the request timed out. The Teams
leave is answered 204 (teams.live.com, 2026-11-04): on sargo every
leave was reported as "no answer" after 30 s, later 120 s, and the
retry then got 404 because the leave had in fact gone through.

1xx responses are left as they were: a 100 Continue is not the final
answer, and none of our requests ask for one.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/EionRobb/purple-teams/pull/98]

---
 purple2compat/http.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/purple2compat/http.c b/purple2compat/http.c
index 2316126..21d0fcb 100644
--- a/purple2compat/http.c
+++ b/purple2compat/http.c
@@ -1175,6 +1175,15 @@ static gboolean _purple_http_recv_loopbody(PurpleHttpConnection *hc, gint fd)
 			if (!purple_http_headers_get_int(hc->response->headers,
 				"Content-Length", &hc->length_expected))
 				hc->length_expected = -1;
+			/* webOS: 204 and 304 responses never have a body
+			 * (RFC 9112 6.3), whatever their headers say. Without a
+			 * Content-Length the response was otherwise read until the
+			 * server closed the connection, which on a kept-alive one it
+			 * does not: a 204 (the Teams leave's answer) then went
+			 * unreported until the request timed out. (1xx is left
+			 * alone: a 100 Continue is not the final answer.) */
+			if (hc->response->code == 204 || hc->response->code == 304)
+				hc->length_expected = 0;
 			hc->is_chunked = (purple_http_headers_match(
 				hc->response->headers,
 				"Transfer-Encoding", "chunked"));
-- 
